reatures-terrific; and competent to rive (all things). Flaming up with wrath, Ravana took this dart.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-102-40"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6091012","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"65ed941beacac5cfd4d26017fd8cc9f8d86944c320989aa023d529e90f954a18","compact":"988b236a1d867e24f6a4053c7341e344c0948d188ddfd0ab9c0ae7d674e7d49c","nasal":"988b236a1d867e24f6a4053c7341e344c0948d188ddfd0ab9c0ae7d674e7d49c"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-91-13","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":91,"verse":13,"english":"And fired with furious wrath, that powerful one took the dart in the encounter, surrounded in that contest by many heroic Rākşasas. And uplifting (the dart), the huge-bodied Ravana, with his eyes reddened in passion, emitted mighty roars. And the shouts ofd the Rākşasa sovereign made the earth and the sky and the cardinal quarters and all sides tremble.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.452,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-102-41"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6091013","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"6e084656f0e4ebd2b2402c36f830cff74dfe95d1574178e525409ea301b89e4d","compact":"0a84cb19695c12fa868b9f984908819d5571776754503546f4acc245fdb29bac","nasal":"0a84cb19695c12fa868b9f984908819d5571776754503546f4acc245fdb29bac"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-91-14","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":91,"verse":14,"english":"And fired with furious wrath, that powerful one took the dart in the encounter, surrounded in that contest by many heroic Rākşasas. And uplifting (the dart), the huge-bodied Ravana, with his eyes reddened in passion, emitted mighty roars. And the shouts ofd the Rākşasa sovereign made the earth and the sky and the cardinal quarters and all sides tremble.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confi